Hi All,

Just to let everyone know that the Motorola HS-850 Headset works very
nicely. I think the HS-810 will work as well as its basically
identical to the HS-850, with the later being just a upgrade with
support for BT1.2 and better battery life. The audio is really nice
and it seems with basic testing to work well with Gnomemeeting. The
problem I was having with the HS-810 was a user problem, with me not
reading the instructions properly and hitting the connect button :-P
I'll test the HS-810 next week when I get access to it again.

Looking forward to further developments.

Regards
Pete


